## Framework Bugs And Feature Requests

If you hit an Akan.js bug, or a fix that one framework change would solve more easily than app-level workarounds,
draft a GitHub issue for <https://github.com/akan-team/akanjs/issues> (version, repro, expected vs actual) and ask
the user before filing it. Keep any interim workaround small and marked `// TODO: <issue url>`.

